        <mxCell id="legend3" value="Read top-to-bottom = chronological. Read left-to-right = how the 4 UUIDs are reused across tables." style="text;html=1;align=center;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
